"text\", \"q\": \"the Healthy People 2020 target (80%) for adolescents aged 13–15 years was met nationally for the fifth survey year\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistical comparisons were made using t-tests on weighted data to account for the complex survey design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences were considered statistically significant at p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Sampling weights were adjusted for dual-frame (landline and cellular telephone), nonresponse, noncoverage, and overlapping samples of mixed telephone users.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"Estimates with 95% CI half-widths >10 might not be reliable.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}